# Tools make fetches on demand (homelabctl).
.bin/

# Build outputs. Three producers, which is why this is one rule at the
# root rather than three beside them: pokedex-web and pokedex-htmx both
# `vite build` here, and pokedex/clients/ts compiles here with tsc
# before it is packed for npm. The scaffolded service .gitignore also
# names clients/ts/dist, for a single-service repo where that IS the
# root - harmless to have both.
dist/
